  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Two months after Wang Xiao reaches San Cha Mountain, she holds a great battle with him that ends in a draw. Her showing is said to exceed Ku Mo and Wu Gui. Wu clan stands as the number one clan dominating southern border when she appears there.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wang_xiao",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_ku_mo",
        "char_wu_gui",
        "fac_wu_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the three kings inheritance opens again, she cups her fists to Tie Mu Bai and yields the first choice of entrance, then enters after him with Wang Xiao and the other rank five Gu Masters.",
      "chapters": [
        376
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_mu_bai",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has beautiful eyes and a beautiful flower-like appearance.",
      "chapters": [
        381
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even as cousin of the current Wu clan leader, she bows despite her pride when facing Tie Mu Bai. Fang Yuan appears before her inside the inheritance ground. Narration calls her a famed rank five Gu Master who calms her mind in seconds. She recognizes him as Little Beast King and asks how he can enter and exit at will. A bone spear pierces her heart. At her fall, mysterious light carries her three rank five Gu away through space; Fang Yuan treats this as Wu clan’s rank six Immortal Gu no loss Gu retrieving precious Gu, takes her remaining rank four Gu, and has beast placenta Gu swallow her aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        381
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inside-the-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_little_beast_king",
        "gu_no_loss_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five rank five Gu Masters on San Cha mountain, Fang Yuan places her with Wang Xiao at rank five upper stage, below Tie Mu Bai, Ku Mo, and Wu Gui at peak stage, and above Chou Jiu at initial stage.",
      "chapters": [
        381
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inside-the-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chou_jiu"
      ]
    }
  ],
